      <div type="clause" n="22">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 22</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And hwilum wearð geworden, swa swa God wolde, sceaphyrde to cynge and se wearð swyþe mære; eac wearð geworden, swa swa God wolde, fiscere to biscope and se wæs swyþe dyre 7 Christe gecweme.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And it once came to pass, just as God decreed, that a shepherd became a king and he was exceedingly great; it also came to pass, just as God decreed, a fisherman became a bishop, and he was greatly beloved and pleasing to Christ.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 hwilum wearð geworden, swa swa God wolde, sceaphyrde to cynge 7 se wearð swyþe mære; eac wearð geworden, swa swa God wolde, fiscere to biscope 7 se wæs swyþe dyre 7 Christe gecweme.</ab>
      </div>
